# LONA workflows

- Connect to `https://mcp.lona.agency/mcp` with OAuth and follow its current instructions and schemas.
- Read `lona_get_strategy_documentation` before authoring. Validate complete source with `lona_run_dry_run_backtest` before saving it. Use returned IDs after creates and immutable updates.
- Resolve the symbol, date coverage, and cached frequency before execution. Follow account plan limits.
- Run only requested work; a preview must not execute an analysis. Backtests and optimizations may consume entitlements or credits.
- Retain job IDs, use the advertised wait tools, and inspect terminal status and actual results. Do not automatically resubmit executions after errors or timeouts.
- Only `lona_show_*` tools request interactive views; absence of chart objects in returned data does not imply a missing view.
- Keep in-sample optimization separate from out-of-sample validation and explain the actual date boundaries in Walk-Forward Analysis.
